r0 read p0
event at r0 0
tok at r0 1
x31 call css_a tok
x62 call css_b x31
x90 call css_c x62
x121 call css_d x90
x152 call css_e x121
x156 call css_f x152
x157 call nav x156 
x195 call sec_hero x157
x226 call sec_pitch x195
x304 call sec_sample x226
x599 call sec_fast x304
x935 call sec_edit x599
x1065 call sec_check x935
x1164 call sec_targets x1065
x1221 call sec_try x1164
x1313 call sec_terms x1221
x1316 call sec_close x1313
x1317 call foot x1316 
x1318 write x1317 6
x1319 write x1318 0
ret event
end
